<content><![CDATA[<p>Export models and textures from Blender and bring them into PlayCanvas with correct scale, materials and lighting.</p>
<h2>Learning Objectives</h2>
<ol>
<li>Export glTF/GLB files with correct transforms</li>
<li>Set up PBR materials in PlayCanvas</li>
<li>Light and preview assets in a real-time scene</li>
</ol>
